This directory contains Supabase configuration and database migrations.

Structure:
  supabase/
    config.toml         — Supabase local dev config
    migrations/
      001_initial_schema.sql
      002_rls_policies.sql
      003_rpc_functions.sql
      004_seed_items.sql

Migrations are ordered and immutable once applied to production.
Do not rename, reorder, or rewrite applied migrations.
Owned by Smarak.
